{
    "title": "Pedometer App - Step Counter",
    "description": "Pedometer App - Step Counter, a simple & accurate step tracker to track your daily steps, walking distance, time and burned calories.\r\n\r\nThis app features clear daily, weekly, and monthly charts so you can see your activity data at a glance. It works on all Android devices, counts steps with sensors instead of GPS, and also supports offline use.\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Why choose Pedometer App - Step Counter?</b>\r\n\u2726 Free & easy to use\r\n\u2726 Accurate step counting\r\n\u2726 Detailed activity data charts\r\n\u2726 One-click share walking reports\r\n\u2726 Handy screen widgets\r\n\u2726 Available offline\r\n\u2726 No GPS tracking\r\n\u2726 Work on all Android devices\r\n\u2726 Colorful themes\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0f <b>Easy-to-use Step Counter</b>\r\nNo wearable device required, just put your phone in your pocket, bag, or hold it in hand to auto start counting steps. It uses sensors instead of GPS to track steps, saving a lot of battery.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udeb6 <b>Accurate Step Tracker</b>\r\nAdjust sensor sensitivity to ensure more accurate step counting. Even if the screen is locked or there is no network connection, all steps will be automatically counted to live up to your every step.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcdd <b>Manually Edit Steps</b>\r\nYou can manually edit the number of steps by time period to reflect your actual exercise situation. No more worries about losing your step records!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcca <b>Activity Data Analysis</b>\r\nGet insights into your activity levels with detailed graphs showing steps, walking time, distance, and calories burned. You can view data by day, week or month, and understand your most active times and exercise trends.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 <b>Handy Screen Widgets</b>\r\nEasily add widgets to your home screen to track your daily steps without entering the app. You can also customize the size or style of widgets according to your preference.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 <b>Personalized Themes</b>\r\nColorful themes are available for you to choose from: fresh lawn green, quiet lake blue, vibrant sunshine yellow... You can customize it to your liking, adding color and vitality to your walking journey.\r\n\r\n<b>Features coming soon:</b>\r\n\ud83e\udd5b Water tracker - Remind you to drink water on time;\r\n\ud83d\udcc9 Weight tracker - Record and follow your weight changes;\r\n\ud83c\udfc5Achievements - Unlock badges as you reach different fitness levels;\r\n\ud83c\udfbe Personalized activities - Track training data for various sports;\r\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Workout map - Visualize your activity routes;\r\n\u2601\ufe0f Data backup - Sync your health data to Google Drive.\r\n\r\n\u2699\ufe0f Permissions required:\r\n- Notification permission is required to send you reminders;\r\n- Physical activity permission is required to calculate your step data;\r\n- Storage permission is required to store step data on your device.\u00a0\r\n\r\nStep Counter - Pedometer App is not only a walk tracker, but also a leader in healthy living. This pedometer free & versatile fitness tracker accurately records your fitness efforts, providing detailed insights into your activity levels. Whether you're looking for a walk tracker, distance tracker to monitor your daily activity or a comprehensive fitness tracker to analyze your health data, Step Tracker has you covered. Just try this steps app now!\r\n\r\nWe value your feedback and suggestions! If you have any questions or ideas, please feel free to contact us at stepappfeedback@gmail.com. Let's embark on this fitness journey together!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Pedometer App - Step Counter, a simple &amp; accurate step tracker to track your daily steps, walking distance, time and burned calories.<br><br>This app features clear daily, weekly, and monthly charts so you can see your activity data at a glance. It works on all Android devices, counts steps with sensors instead of GPS, and also supports offline use.<br><br>\u2728 <b>Why choose Pedometer App - Step Counter?</b><br>\u2726 Free &amp; easy to use<br>\u2726 Accurate step counting<br>\u2726 Detailed activity data charts<br>\u2726 One-click share walking reports<br>\u2726 Handy screen widgets<br>\u2726 Available offline<br>\u2726 No GPS tracking<br>\u2726 Work on all Android devices<br>\u2726 Colorful themes<br><br>\u2764\ufe0f <b>Easy-to-use Step Counter</b><br>No wearable device required, just put your phone in your pocket, bag, or hold it in hand to auto start counting steps. It uses sensors instead of GPS to track steps, saving a lot of battery.<br><br>\ud83d\udeb6 <b>Accurate Step Tracker</b><br>Adjust sensor sensitivity to ensure more accurate step counting. Even if the screen is locked or there is no network connection, all steps will be automatically counted to live up to your every step.<br><br>\ud83d\udcdd <b>Manually Edit Steps</b><br>You can manually edit the number of steps by time period to reflect your actual exercise situation. No more worries about losing your step records!<br><br>\ud83d\udcca <b>Activity Data Analysis</b><br>Get insights into your activity levels with detailed graphs showing steps, walking time, distance, and calories burned. You can view data by day, week or month, and understand your most active times and exercise trends.<br><br>\ud83d\udcf1 <b>Handy Screen Widgets</b><br>Easily add widgets to your home screen to track your daily steps without entering the app. You can also customize the size or style of widgets according to your preference.<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 <b>Personalized Themes</b><br>Colorful themes are available for you to choose from: fresh lawn green, quiet lake blue, vibrant sunshine yellow... You can customize it to your liking, adding color and vitality to your walking journey.<br><br><b>Features coming soon:</b><br>\ud83e\udd5b Water tracker - Remind you to drink water on time;<br>\ud83d\udcc9 Weight tracker - Record and follow your weight changes;<br>\ud83c\udfc5Achievements - Unlock badges as you reach different fitness levels;<br>\ud83c\udfbe Personalized activities - Track training data for various sports;<br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Workout map - Visualize your activity routes;<br>\u2601\ufe0f Data backup - Sync your health data to Google Drive.<br><br>\u2699\ufe0f Permissions required:<br>- Notification permission is required to send you reminders;<br>- Physical activity permission is required to calculate your step data;<br>- Storage permission is required to store step data on your device.\u00a0<br><br>Step Counter - Pedometer App is not only a walk tracker, but also a leader in healthy living. This pedometer free &amp; versatile fitness tracker accurately records your fitness efforts, providing detailed insights into your activity levels. Whether you&#39;re looking for a walk tracker, distance tracker to monitor your daily activity or a comprehensive fitness tracker to analyze your health data, Step Tracker has you covered. Just try this steps app now!<br><br>We value your feedback and suggestions! If you have any questions or ideas, please feel free to contact us at stepappfeedback@gmail.com. Let&#39;s embark on this fitness journey together!",
